 Make flag;⎕IO;⎕ML;parms;ref;cfg;xml
⍝ Version 3.5.0 ⋄ 2025-08-23
⍝ Starts the appropriate version of APL and makes sure that this instanc executes ∆Make.
 ⎕IO←1 ⋄ ⎕ML←1
 :If flag
     xml←⊃⎕NGET(##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Make/make.config')
     cfg←⎕XML xml
     :If 1 ##.TestCases.CommTools.YesOrNo'Create new version with:'(3⊃cfg[cfg[;2]⍳⊂'exe';])
         parms←##.TestCases.APLProcess.CreateParms
         parms.WorkspaceName←##.CiderConfig.HOME,'/Make/Make.dws'
         parms.SessionFile←1
         parms.LX←1
         parms.WindowsStyle←'Normal'
         ref←##.TestCases.APLProcess.New parms
         'Something went wrong'Assert ref.HasExited
         'Something went wrong'Assert 0=ref.ExitCode
         InstallMeddy ⍬
     :Else
         ⎕←'Cancelled by user'
     :EndIf
 :EndIf
⍝Done
